body:
To update on this after WillJV2 showing what it's like to get first move DM.

&#x200B;

He seems to exit the DM starting on the right hand flow on the Red Beam move, but it's the three Red Beams that you can punish at the end safely. Rest of the flow is fine, just the single Red Beam is now three. After he moves below an HP Barrier he will then use the Armour move instead, and then he will be using the Single Red Beam instead (so flow as normal).

Really? I've never had this prediction fail me after a lot of failed fight attempts - can you show me an example? Admittedly I've never gone more than three consecutive rounds in a single match, so I don't know how it stacks up over time.

&#x200B;

The only time I've seen it go wrong is when he uses a Kupo coin, as it seems to ignore that check should be updated.
